# Secrets
.env
*.env

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Raw data (large, re-downloadable per README "Re-running" sections)
raw/

# Live data-system store (regenerated by collect.py -- see docs/DATA_SYSTEM.md)
data/
.pytest_cache/
.benchmarks/

# FloodConnect build output, including the static API v1 export
# (site/dist/api/v1/**). FIX D (2026-10-04, project decision -- no hosted access):
# this used to carve out site/dist/api/ as a deliberately TRACKED retained
# snapshot so a fresh clone had something to read offline. That carve-out is
# removed -- this repo ships NO pre-computed flood reading for anyone to read
# without running the pipeline (collect.py --all -> site/build_data.py ->
# tools/api/export_api.py) on their own machine first. The whole directory is
# disposable build output now, nothing under it is ever committed.
site/dist/

# `pip install -e .` generates this; it is build metadata, never source.
*.egg-info/

# Self-install venv (README §4) -- a user's own, never committed.
.venv

# Local-only overrides / scratch (never committed)
.leakdeny.local
*.local
.playwright-mcp/

# Rescued dead-session scratchpad staging (data.json/html blobs -- never committed)
.redesign_v2_staging/

# Self-labelled internal-use-only community note (ends "ใช้ภายใน") -- kept
# available locally for site/build_data.py's optional extra-source read, never
# tracked/published. build_community_extra_20260927()/build_exits_extra_20260927()
# already return [] gracefully when this path is absent, same as any installer
# who never has this file.
site/inputs/community/community_reports_2026-09-27.md
